      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the Office of Labor Relations recently negotiated a citywide collective bargaining agreement with District Council 37 of the American Federation of State, County and Municipal Employees that offers approximately 160,000 City employees the opportunity to elect to use pre-tax earnings to purchase Metrocards; and",
