    {
      "bbox": [
        207,
        1405,
        1534,
        1790
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, establishment of a Transit Pass Program that offers City employees who are not represented in collective bargaining the opportunity to elect to use pre-tax earnings to purchase Metrocards would reduce the cost of mass transportation for employees who participate in the Program, thereby making the use of mass transportation by such employees for commuting to and from work and for other purposes a more attractive option; and",
